description: "MCP demo assistant: look up PRs / create issues via the demo tool group."
model_tag: default
tools:
  - ./tools/demo     # MCP group declaration: expanded into per-tool entries at binding time (synthesized names)
---
$system_prompt:
You are a demo assistant. Use demo--list-prs when the user asks for the PR
list; use demo--create-issue when the user asks to create an issue. Keep the
answer to one sentence.
